WEBVTT

01:30.480 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:41.520 --> 01:42.560
There is such a long secret tunnel

01:42.640 --> 01:44.320
hidden under my mother's room.

01:44.960 --> 01:46.720
I can't believe that
my father never told me about it.

01:47.480 --> 01:49.960
It seems that Gao Fengxu,
has been hiding a lot of secrets

01:50.040 --> 01:51.720
to you, his daughter.

02:36.520 --> 02:38.160
This stone bed is covered
by Spirit Gathering Arrays.

02:39.800 --> 02:40.720
The only thing that does

02:40.800 --> 02:43.280
is to absorb the aura of nature

02:43.360 --> 02:44.920
for cultivators to use.

02:45.760 --> 02:46.760
So,

02:47.760 --> 02:49.720
my father locked my mother up in here

02:50.600 --> 02:51.960
to nourish the Chaos Pearl.

02:55.400 --> 02:56.480
I think

02:58.360 --> 02:59.880
the truth might be even crueler.

03:01.000 --> 03:02.160
What truth?

03:07.440 --> 03:09.160
I'm a tuco-tuco.

03:12.440 --> 03:13.320
A kid.

03:13.400 --> 03:15.640
Just a filthy spirit slave
without a spirit lock.

03:15.720 --> 03:17.640
Take her away. Madam's task comes first.

03:17.720 --> 03:18.760
Prepare the sword array

03:18.840 --> 03:20.080
and destroy this place.

03:23.960 --> 03:24.800
There is no window.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.960
The sunshine

03:27.560 --> 03:28.920
and noises
from the outside world can't get in.

03:29.560 --> 03:32.040
There is no trace
of anyone ever living here.

03:32.120 --> 03:33.960
Just a stone bed covered
by Spirit Gathering Arrays.

03:34.760 --> 03:35.600
The size

03:36.280 --> 03:38.160
doesn't even allow any movement.

03:42.440 --> 03:43.400
So…

03:43.480 --> 03:46.240
So, this place is not
for holding a living person.

03:46.920 --> 03:48.560
It's for keeping a dead body.

03:59.600 --> 04:00.440
Miss Gao…

04:01.720 --> 04:04.160
I'm fine. Go on.

04:07.200 --> 04:08.920
The body of a Primal Celestial Maiden

04:09.000 --> 04:10.680
contains endless vitality.

04:11.200 --> 04:12.480
No one knows if that will disperse

04:13.000 --> 04:14.920
as she dies.

04:15.000 --> 04:16.920
Your father visited this place often

04:17.440 --> 04:18.839
after your mother passed away.

04:19.920 --> 04:20.760
I think

04:21.839 --> 04:23.760
he was using your mother's body

04:24.520 --> 04:26.080
to keep nourishing the Chaos Pearl.

04:27.400 --> 04:28.640
The Spirit Gathering Array

04:29.600 --> 04:32.040
is to keep the vitality inside her

04:32.720 --> 04:33.800
from stopping generating.

05:21.160 --> 05:22.400
Mother!

05:23.320 --> 05:24.800
Miss Gao…

05:33.960 --> 05:37.400
Let me go! Leave me! Let me go!

05:37.480 --> 05:38.600
Don't kill me.

05:38.680 --> 05:39.680
-Go!
-Please!

05:39.760 --> 05:41.800
-Please!
-Come here.

05:43.840 --> 05:46.480
Don't kill me. Please.

05:46.560 --> 05:47.760
Please!

06:03.320 --> 06:04.520
Father!

06:05.040 --> 06:06.440
Father, is it you who saved me?

06:06.520 --> 06:08.480
Father! Where are you?

06:08.560 --> 06:11.120
Come out so that I can see you.

06:11.200 --> 06:12.520
Father!

06:12.600 --> 06:13.560
Father!

06:14.520 --> 06:16.600
I want to see you.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.160
Father!

06:20.400 --> 06:21.240
-Father!
-Bao!

06:21.320 --> 06:23.920
Do you not want Mother and I anymore?

06:25.480 --> 06:27.080
Father!

06:27.960 --> 06:30.280
Father!

06:32.640 --> 06:34.840
Mr. Gao was once the leader
of the Immortal Alliance.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.680
Would he commit something like that?

06:37.840 --> 06:38.960
When Miss Gao said

06:40.120 --> 06:42.600
that Saint Miaohua was held captive
and tortured by Madam Su for years,

06:43.520 --> 06:44.680
I thought that was weird.

06:45.280 --> 06:47.520
If Saint Miaohua just asked
Su Ningxi to marry Mr. Gao

06:48.440 --> 06:49.680
and forced her to nourish the Chaos Pearl,

06:50.440 --> 06:52.120
why would Madam Su hate her so much?

06:54.600 --> 06:55.840
I'm going to my mother's tomb.

06:59.840 --> 07:02.080
Master said that my mother
was buried with my father.

07:04.720 --> 07:06.880
I will see for myself if she is there.

07:08.280 --> 07:10.480
If Mirage Palace
still has the Chaos Pearl,

07:10.560 --> 07:11.400
-then--
-No matter what,

07:12.400 --> 07:14.080
the truth shouldn't be buried.

07:14.160 --> 07:16.560
Whoever did all evil things
for the Chaos Pearl

07:17.840 --> 07:19.520
should face the consequences.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.840
The array is about to be ready.
Where is he?

07:24.520 --> 07:25.520
-Let's forget about him.
-Yes.

07:25.600 --> 07:27.320
We need to hurry up
and destroy this place.

07:35.240 --> 07:36.160
What's going on?

07:39.880 --> 07:41.360
Let's go. This place is going down.

07:41.440 --> 07:42.720
Come on.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.280
Watch out!

07:59.000 --> 08:00.320
Are you staying at your crime scene

08:00.400 --> 08:02.120
so that the victims can get their revenge?

08:02.200 --> 08:03.320
You are not getting out of here alive.

08:04.440 --> 08:05.920
I don't have time to waste on you.

08:33.400 --> 08:34.440
You are not controlled by Heartstring.

08:36.360 --> 08:38.159
It's too hard to kill you.

08:38.240 --> 08:39.799
I wanted to take the chance to get away,

08:40.360 --> 08:42.440
and these two
annoying people got in my way.

08:43.039 --> 08:44.720
Why did you travel with me
in the first place?

08:44.800 --> 08:46.760
To get the Chaos Pearl.

08:46.840 --> 08:48.640
I've been telling you the truth.

08:48.720 --> 08:50.080
The Chaos Pearl is still missing.

08:51.760 --> 08:53.120
Why not keep lying to me?

08:53.200 --> 08:55.720
I got the clue I wanted.

08:55.800 --> 08:58.160
My master can take over from here.

08:58.880 --> 09:01.560
As for you, maybe just die here.

09:02.360 --> 09:03.480
However,

09:04.760 --> 09:07.200
you still can't kill me, can you?

09:09.680 --> 09:11.760
Mu Xuanling. Were you trying to kill me?

09:15.280 --> 09:16.640
What's going on?

09:16.720 --> 09:18.920
Where is Bao? Bao!

09:19.520 --> 09:20.360
Bao!

09:20.960 --> 09:21.960
Lansheng. Qiumin.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.040
Bao!

09:25.560 --> 09:26.640
Why is your face bleeding?

09:27.320 --> 09:28.280
Are you hurt?

09:28.360 --> 09:30.480
That's not my blood.

09:30.560 --> 09:32.280
The cultivators from Mirage Palace

09:33.200 --> 09:34.640
tried to kill me.

09:35.920 --> 09:37.280
My father saved me.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.880
Your father. Did you see him?

09:41.360 --> 09:42.840
He won't come out and meet with me.

09:42.920 --> 09:43.960
He got away again.

09:44.040 --> 09:45.760
It seems that this little girl's father

09:45.840 --> 09:47.320
is no common man.

09:47.960 --> 09:48.800
Xuanling.

09:50.040 --> 09:52.000
Xuanling, why are you tied up?

09:53.080 --> 09:54.880
She's a bad person. She should be tied up.

09:56.280 --> 09:58.320
But Xuanling is not a bad person.

09:58.400 --> 10:00.480
Xuanling. You are not a bad person, right?

10:00.560 --> 10:01.440
Yes. Bao.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.280
I'm not a bad person.

10:03.360 --> 10:04.960
Will you help me?

10:08.160 --> 10:09.200
Miss Mu.

10:10.680 --> 10:11.800
Whatever you want,

10:12.400 --> 10:14.160
don't trick and use a child.

10:16.760 --> 10:18.120
The cultivators
from Mirage Palace are dead.

10:19.040 --> 10:20.400
They can't report to duty.

10:21.280 --> 10:22.680
Madam Su will get suspicious soon.

10:22.760 --> 10:24.880
There's no time to waste.
Let's go to the graveyard first.

10:25.560 --> 10:26.720
What about her?

10:32.040 --> 10:33.120
I'll keep her close.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.840
There's nobody in the coffin, as expected.

10:43.120 --> 10:44.760
It's getting late.
Let's find a staging post

10:44.840 --> 10:46.720
-and rest for the night.
-Mr. Xie

10:47.280 --> 10:49.920
may have underestimated
the power of your Jade Vault Technique.

10:51.360 --> 10:53.120
I have got a lot of new information today.

10:53.200 --> 10:54.040
I'm going to report to duty.

10:54.120 --> 10:56.160
-Xuanling!
-See? She's a bad person.

11:03.000 --> 11:04.200
Move aside.

11:04.280 --> 11:05.960
I will never let you
get back to Sang Qi again.

11:07.040 --> 11:08.080
Mu Xuanling.

11:09.160 --> 11:10.280
You have other choices.

11:10.360 --> 11:11.880
Xie Xuechen.

11:11.960 --> 11:13.440
Stop lying to yourself.

11:13.520 --> 11:15.360
I am the same as my master.

11:16.040 --> 11:17.480
You and I are not the same kind of people.

11:17.560 --> 11:19.360
You love humanity and the world.

11:19.960 --> 11:21.200
I am a member of the Spirit Clan.

11:21.280 --> 11:24.000
This world
has never treated me with kindness.

11:24.080 --> 11:25.360
And I

11:26.000 --> 11:29.240
have never loved this world or you.

11:30.280 --> 11:31.160
I've been lying to you

11:32.560 --> 11:33.880
from the beginning.

11:39.040 --> 11:40.520
I've seen your true heart.

11:42.000 --> 11:43.560
Don't do anything that you will regret.

11:49.160 --> 11:51.040
Are you really that unwilling
to let me go?

11:52.760 --> 11:54.120
How about this?

11:55.240 --> 11:57.040
Come back to the Dark Abyss with me.

11:58.120 --> 12:01.880
Use your intelligence and power
to eliminate Sang Qi

12:01.960 --> 12:03.640
and become the new Lord of the Dark Abyss.

12:04.240 --> 12:05.240
That should be easy for you.

12:06.240 --> 12:09.000
In that case,
you've gotten rid of Sang Qi for good,

12:09.080 --> 12:11.520
and we will be on the same path.

12:14.400 --> 12:16.360
What do you think, Mr. Xie?

12:30.000 --> 12:31.280
You shouldn't go back to that life.

12:33.560 --> 12:34.640
How stubborn.

12:45.880 --> 12:47.640
You are not getting away. Give up.

12:48.360 --> 12:49.680
What do you care?

13:00.000 --> 13:00.840
Stay away!

13:00.920 --> 13:02.280
Xuanling!

13:02.960 --> 13:04.680
You are bleeding.

13:05.440 --> 13:06.480
Bao!

13:22.720 --> 13:23.680
Mr. Xie.

13:30.920 --> 13:33.400
The blood… Is that yours?

13:41.640 --> 13:42.480
Only the blood of a direct relative

13:42.560 --> 13:44.160
can activate a blood mirror.

13:44.840 --> 13:46.240
It's Miss Mu's blood on the mirror,

13:47.000 --> 13:48.080
yet Miss Gao can see.

13:49.360 --> 13:50.480
You two are direct relatives.

13:50.560 --> 13:52.440
You are sisters.

13:54.960 --> 13:57.040
How is that possible?
Who are you calling her sister?

14:05.880 --> 14:06.920
So, Miss Mu.

14:07.800 --> 14:09.680
-Are you still leaving?
-What do you think?

14:09.760 --> 14:10.880
Before we get to the bottom of this,
no one is leaving.

14:12.040 --> 14:13.240
You first.

14:13.320 --> 14:14.160
It's not like I'm intimidated.

14:14.240 --> 14:16.200
I don't believe
in something so ridiculous.

14:16.280 --> 14:17.360
I'm not afraid.

14:18.920 --> 14:19.960
See?

14:36.800 --> 14:38.000
How…

14:38.080 --> 14:39.320
How did that happen?

14:42.440 --> 14:43.880
It's… It's impossible.

14:43.960 --> 14:45.800
This is absurd. It can't be true.

14:45.880 --> 14:48.400
I am a member of the Spirit Clan
while she's a human.

14:48.480 --> 14:49.800
How can we be direct relatives?

14:50.520 --> 14:51.560
Maybe you have

14:51.640 --> 14:52.760
the same mother and different fathers.

14:52.840 --> 14:54.000
Don't knock it!

14:54.080 --> 14:56.840
If my mother gave birth to two children,
how could I not know?

14:56.920 --> 14:58.640
How could no one know?

14:58.720 --> 15:00.120
The only explanation is that,

15:00.200 --> 15:01.200
Fu Lansheng,

15:01.800 --> 15:02.880
your blood mirror is not working.

15:02.960 --> 15:04.400
That must be it!

15:04.480 --> 15:06.160
You can say what you want about me,

15:06.240 --> 15:07.640
but our artifacts always work.

15:07.720 --> 15:10.480
Studying artifacts is the livelihood
of Jade Sky Palace for a thousand years.

15:10.560 --> 15:11.520
How could we make mistakes?

15:12.600 --> 15:13.600
Let me show you!

15:19.160 --> 15:22.560
LOVESTORY AT AN EMBROIDERY ROOM

15:22.640 --> 15:23.760
What's that?

15:24.840 --> 15:26.560
-It's not for a kid to see.
-What are you doing?

15:26.640 --> 15:29.240
What? I didn't even see it clearly.

15:29.320 --> 15:30.560
What is that?

15:30.640 --> 15:32.440
What is it?

15:32.520 --> 15:34.360
Let me go!

15:39.840 --> 15:41.280
What is that?

15:41.360 --> 15:43.080
-What's that?
-Sorry. I want to ask you guys

15:43.160 --> 15:44.440
to keep this a secret among us.

15:45.280 --> 15:46.400
Save my father some dignity.

15:55.880 --> 15:56.800
Judging from the situation,

15:57.360 --> 15:58.600
we'll have to ask

15:58.680 --> 15:59.960
Madam Su about all this
at the Mirage Palace.

16:03.280 --> 16:05.320
BRIGHT MOON INN

16:18.200 --> 16:22.520
DECAYING IMMORTAL PAVILION

16:45.800 --> 16:48.040
They've been to the tomb
in Moonlight Heights.

16:49.280 --> 16:50.560
Su Ningxi's coffin

16:51.600 --> 16:52.640
was empty.

16:53.720 --> 16:56.040
They are traveling to Mirage Palace next.

16:58.920 --> 17:00.480
Xie Xuechen might be smart,

17:00.560 --> 17:01.840
but he's unlikely to think

17:02.360 --> 17:03.880
that you'd come to my place

17:04.400 --> 17:05.480
after leaving the Two Realms Mountain.

17:07.760 --> 17:09.040
Isn't this your idea?

17:10.640 --> 17:11.640
I usually get my medicine

17:11.720 --> 17:14.400
on the first day of each month.

17:15.000 --> 17:16.280
This month, there's still no news

17:16.960 --> 17:18.319
about the medicine on the eighth.

17:19.280 --> 17:22.160
You were forcing me to come here.

17:28.640 --> 17:31.400
All people say that Mr. Nan
is a warm and gentle man.

17:31.480 --> 17:34.640
How come you are always so mean
when talking to me?

17:35.400 --> 17:38.480
I have saved your life, at least to say.

17:40.800 --> 17:44.600
Back then, your sibling born
by your stepmother set you up,

17:44.680 --> 17:46.400
and a demonic cultivator kept you captive
and tortured you.

17:47.320 --> 17:48.880
I was the one

17:48.960 --> 17:50.160
who saved you at the critical moment.

17:57.120 --> 17:58.880
Sometimes I'd rather you didn't

17:59.760 --> 18:01.120
when I think about that.

18:01.840 --> 18:02.960
But you chose to live

18:03.040 --> 18:04.800
on your own.

18:06.000 --> 18:07.520
I didn't force you.

18:20.640 --> 18:22.120
In the 10,000 years of this world,

18:22.800 --> 18:25.640
there were only two people
born with ten spiritual channels.

18:27.720 --> 18:29.760
Xie Xuechen is having a good life.

18:30.400 --> 18:32.240
But how come you are
in this bad situation?

18:35.600 --> 18:37.120
You've lost nine out of ten
of your vitality.

18:37.800 --> 18:41.320
That one point is close to nothing.

18:43.480 --> 18:44.600
I'll give you a choice.

18:45.600 --> 18:46.960
Take your life

18:47.720 --> 18:49.400
with this sword if you want to give up.

18:54.160 --> 18:55.320
Or if you want to live,

18:57.200 --> 18:58.800
take the medicine.

19:00.040 --> 19:01.480
There is one thing bad about the medicine.

19:02.080 --> 19:05.040
Once you take it,
you will have to take it every month.

19:07.080 --> 19:10.280
That's how you can stay alive.

19:13.360 --> 19:14.480
If you stop taking the medicine,

19:15.840 --> 19:16.880
you will be dead

19:17.480 --> 19:19.240
with double the pain

19:20.040 --> 19:22.000
within a year.

19:24.560 --> 19:25.840
If it's revenge that you want,

19:27.040 --> 19:30.320
I can help you with that if you are dead.

19:32.120 --> 19:33.480
Have you thought this through?

21:12.040 --> 21:13.160
The Spirit Clan.

21:14.520 --> 21:16.320
The Spirit Clan slaughtered this place.

21:17.480 --> 21:20.680
You knew, didn't you?

21:21.600 --> 21:24.920
Do you still hate Xingye and me?

21:25.560 --> 21:26.600
So,

21:27.520 --> 21:30.360
you let the Spirit Clan slaughter us.

21:37.920 --> 21:39.680
Xue and my brother hate me.

21:41.640 --> 21:44.280
They colluded with someone
and destroyed my spiritual channels.

21:44.960 --> 21:47.000
You led your disciples
to suppress the Spirit Clan.

21:48.120 --> 21:50.800
That's why they retaliated
and brought massacre to this place.

21:52.720 --> 21:54.120
This is my fate.

21:55.120 --> 21:56.640
And yours as well.

21:57.760 --> 21:59.880
It is the fate of Greenview Heights.

22:10.960 --> 22:12.000
Father,

22:14.120 --> 22:16.800
you are going to ruin a master

22:17.960 --> 22:20.040
for a dead kid.

22:21.560 --> 22:22.600
Right?

22:46.640 --> 22:48.840
You didn't let me down.

22:50.160 --> 22:51.480
From now on,

22:52.000 --> 22:56.800
you are the master of Greenview Heights.

23:09.440 --> 23:12.520
You had your revenge
and met with the person you want to meet.

23:13.040 --> 23:13.880
Mr. Nan,

23:14.480 --> 23:17.200
where is the Chaos Pearl
that we agreed on?

23:22.720 --> 23:27.280
I promised you
three wishes to pay back your help.

23:28.320 --> 23:30.520
Your first request

23:30.600 --> 23:32.880
was to set up a killing array
in Greenview Heights

23:32.960 --> 23:34.400
and stall Xie Xuechen
on his way back to the city.

23:35.040 --> 23:38.440
The second was to break
the double-sided barrier in Snow City

23:38.520 --> 23:39.880
and let Ignorance Demon into the city.

23:40.400 --> 23:43.320
The third was to leave a backdoor
on the All-Seeing Jade Dragon Array

23:44.280 --> 23:47.320
so that the Spirit Clan
can still get into the city.

23:47.400 --> 23:50.560
I have done all three things.

23:51.480 --> 23:53.520
You didn't get the Chaos Pearl.

23:55.320 --> 23:56.640
It is your problem.

23:57.240 --> 23:58.280
I have no part in that.

24:02.760 --> 24:05.360
You are helping
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion

24:05.440 --> 24:08.080
while assisting Xie Xuechen
to fight the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

24:09.280 --> 24:10.360
You are putting me in a hard position.

24:12.720 --> 24:15.280
That is also your problem.

24:15.960 --> 24:17.920
I don't work for you,

24:18.000 --> 24:19.280
so I don't have to follow your order.

24:25.280 --> 24:27.840
As for your threat
of stopping the medicine,

24:29.080 --> 24:31.360
to be honest, whether you are

24:32.040 --> 24:33.040
giving it to me or not

24:34.360 --> 24:35.560
makes no difference to me.

24:35.640 --> 24:37.800
Mr. Nan is a world-famous hero.

24:37.880 --> 24:39.040
How dare I threaten you?

24:40.640 --> 24:41.960
There's one thing that I don't understand.

24:42.920 --> 24:44.880
Mr. Nan has been waiting for so long

24:44.960 --> 24:46.480
to reunite with your old friend.

24:48.040 --> 24:49.440
Are you really letting her go?

24:50.520 --> 24:53.480
Don't you want to take her for your own?

24:56.040 --> 24:56.880
Do you need me

24:57.800 --> 24:59.320
to kill Xie Xuechen?

25:04.560 --> 25:06.400
That's my personal business.

25:07.640 --> 25:09.400
You are no part of this.

25:09.480 --> 25:10.600
I told you

25:11.520 --> 25:13.960
that I wouldn't ask questions about
your collaboration with the Dark Abyss.

25:14.480 --> 25:15.520
You

25:17.360 --> 25:19.160
cannot meddle with my affair.

25:31.680 --> 25:33.280
Mr. Nan, don't be mad.

25:33.920 --> 25:36.280
I understand what you said.

25:37.600 --> 25:38.640
I will not bother you

25:39.560 --> 25:41.520
with what's happening next.

25:42.280 --> 25:45.200
I will get you the medicine
every month on time

25:46.080 --> 25:47.640
for the sake

25:48.440 --> 25:49.800
of our cooperation.

26:00.960 --> 26:03.880
There is one thing that I'm curious about.

26:04.440 --> 26:07.440
More than ten years have passed,

26:08.720 --> 26:11.320
and you haven't aged a day.

26:12.320 --> 26:13.760
You also have

26:14.360 --> 26:17.640
millennium-long treasures, such as
the Phoenix Herb and Illusion Elixir.

26:19.320 --> 26:20.440
Forgive me for intruding,

26:21.800 --> 26:23.000
but how old are you?

26:24.800 --> 26:26.040
I stopped

26:30.760 --> 26:32.240
counting my age

26:33.560 --> 26:35.280
a long time ago.

26:37.600 --> 26:39.160
There's no point.

26:40.240 --> 26:41.280
Living for too long

26:42.040 --> 26:44.120
is not necessarily a good thing.

26:46.840 --> 26:48.640
The price

26:51.000 --> 26:52.440
is way too painful.

26:54.520 --> 26:55.560
Too painful.

27:09.320 --> 27:10.600
Madam,

27:10.680 --> 27:12.440
we've enquired
across the Immortal Alliance.

27:12.960 --> 27:15.200
We don't have news on Qiumin yet.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.400
You know how important she is.

27:19.000 --> 27:20.720
Even if you have to travel
to the Dark Abyss

27:20.800 --> 27:22.400
or sacrifice thousands of people,

27:23.280 --> 27:25.000
do get her back!

27:26.000 --> 27:26.840
Yes.

27:40.680 --> 27:41.720
Ningxi,

27:42.960 --> 27:45.000
I don't have many days left.

27:46.840 --> 27:48.440
If we meet in the afterworld,

27:51.640 --> 27:53.160
will you blame me?

27:55.600 --> 27:57.400
-Here's your money.
-The world is disgusting.

27:57.480 --> 27:59.680
If you knew that they would
become food when they grow up,

27:59.760 --> 28:01.400
why bring them into the world?

28:01.480 --> 28:02.440
Nice.

28:02.520 --> 28:03.760
Ningzhen, run!

28:03.840 --> 28:05.200
Ningxi!

28:17.040 --> 28:18.520
Ningxi, I'm tired.

28:18.600 --> 28:20.280
I can't keep running.

28:20.360 --> 28:21.960
Rest here.

28:22.040 --> 28:23.840
I'll go get you food.

28:36.080 --> 28:36.960
Here.

28:37.040 --> 28:38.440
How did you manage to do that?

28:38.520 --> 28:40.360
I'm not sure.

28:40.440 --> 28:43.080
I just felt its vitality

28:43.160 --> 28:45.440
-and gave it a shot.
-That's wonderful!

28:45.520 --> 28:47.280
We will never have to starve again.

28:47.360 --> 28:50.000
They didn't know what you could do

28:50.080 --> 28:51.480
and tried to eat us.

28:51.560 --> 28:53.480
How stupid!

28:53.560 --> 28:55.440
If someone learns about this,

28:55.520 --> 28:56.880
I will die even more horribly.

28:57.560 --> 28:58.720
I know.

28:58.800 --> 29:00.360
Madam, this is the forest.

29:00.440 --> 29:02.160
There is a location
where the aura is extremely thick.

29:02.240 --> 29:03.960
There could be some talented people here.

29:04.040 --> 29:06.280
Ningxi, I'm scared.

29:06.840 --> 29:08.840
You… What do you want?

29:10.920 --> 29:12.760
The body of a Primal Celestial Maiden.

29:13.720 --> 29:15.440
The legend is real.

29:16.280 --> 29:18.880
There are deities
who reincarnate in this world.

29:21.000 --> 29:21.840
Good kid.

29:22.440 --> 29:23.640
How old are you?

29:23.720 --> 29:25.000
What's your name?

29:25.760 --> 29:28.120
I'm Xi. I'm eight years old.

29:28.200 --> 29:29.520
Xi.

29:32.480 --> 29:34.000
I'm the Madam of Mirage Palace.

29:34.800 --> 29:36.760
Will you come back
to Mirage Palace with me?

29:36.840 --> 29:38.800
I will accept you as my disciple

29:38.880 --> 29:40.600
and teach you cultivation and spells.

29:41.400 --> 29:43.320
You don't have to worry about surviving.

29:43.400 --> 29:46.120
You may even achieve immortality

29:46.200 --> 29:47.320
and go to any corner
of the world as you wish.

29:49.520 --> 29:51.480
I want to be with my sister, Zhen.

29:52.440 --> 29:54.160
Ningxi, I'm scared.

29:54.240 --> 29:56.080
I will protect you forever.

29:56.160 --> 29:57.560
We will never be apart.

30:00.040 --> 30:02.320
I failed to protect Qiumin.

30:06.520 --> 30:08.360
After you left,

30:10.480 --> 30:12.360
I haven't been able to do anything right.

30:15.560 --> 30:17.200
Come with me to the Dark Abyss

30:17.280 --> 30:18.520
and search for our young madam.

30:18.600 --> 30:20.760
Elder, are we really traveling
to the Dark Abyss?

30:20.840 --> 30:22.520
That's Sang Qi's territory.

30:22.600 --> 30:25.320
Elder, it's the young madam. She's back.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.720
Young Madam.

30:26.800 --> 30:27.800
Young Madam.

30:31.040 --> 30:32.560
Madam, Qiumin is back.

30:43.280 --> 30:44.600
Master.

30:46.320 --> 30:47.800
What happened to your hair?

30:47.880 --> 30:48.920
It's okay.

30:50.600 --> 30:51.640
Mr. Xie.

30:56.440 --> 30:57.960
You are back from the Dark Abyss.

31:00.120 --> 31:01.480
Thanks to your prayer,

31:01.560 --> 31:02.720
I will live for a little bit longer.

31:14.240 --> 31:17.000
Mr. Xie, what important business
brought you here?

31:17.840 --> 31:19.160
Things have changed in the Dark Abyss.

31:19.880 --> 31:21.600
This might have something to do
with Sang Qi.

31:22.200 --> 31:23.240
Madam Su, may I ask you

31:24.160 --> 31:25.240
to clear the room?

31:37.600 --> 31:38.640
Madam Su,

31:39.680 --> 31:42.320
how many children has Su Ningxi
given birth to?

31:42.400 --> 31:44.760
What is that supposed to mean?

31:44.840 --> 31:46.480
The whole world knows

31:46.560 --> 31:47.640
that my sister was married to Gao Fengxu

31:47.720 --> 31:49.760
and gave birth to a girl.

31:49.840 --> 31:51.120
She left this world right after that.

31:51.960 --> 31:53.000
I mean no offense.

31:53.800 --> 31:55.840
I got an artifact from Fu Lansheng,

31:56.440 --> 31:59.080
and a test says that Miss Gao
is related to Mu Xuanling.

32:02.520 --> 32:04.800
Mr. Xie, how ridiculous.

32:05.840 --> 32:06.920
Are you saying

32:08.640 --> 32:10.640
that they are sisters?

32:13.760 --> 32:15.880
My sister has only one child,

32:15.960 --> 32:17.000
and that is Qiumin.

32:20.640 --> 32:22.080
Were you there

32:22.760 --> 32:23.920
when she was in labor?

32:24.000 --> 32:25.680
Of course.

32:26.320 --> 32:28.520
When Qiumin was born,
there were unworldly views.

32:28.600 --> 32:30.960
The room was so full of light
that it was too bright to see.

32:31.040 --> 32:32.400
Too bright to see.

32:33.000 --> 32:34.920
So, you didn't actually see.

32:36.000 --> 32:37.160
Mr. Xie,

32:37.240 --> 32:38.960
are you trying to smudge my sister's name?

32:39.040 --> 32:41.600
My sister did have a history with Sang Qi,

32:41.680 --> 32:43.640
but they couldn't have had a child.

32:43.720 --> 32:45.520
Back then, my sister was…

32:52.720 --> 32:54.960
Master, calm down first.

32:55.040 --> 32:56.640
We just want to know the truth.

32:56.720 --> 32:58.280
We are not trying
to ruin my mother's reputation.

32:58.360 --> 33:00.560
Madam Su, forgive me
for being presumptuous.

33:01.200 --> 33:04.240
Gao Qiumin's talent
is not worthy of an unworldly view.

33:05.040 --> 33:06.760
Mr. Xie and Mr. Nan

33:06.840 --> 33:08.080
were born with ten spiritual channels,

33:08.160 --> 33:10.800
but they didn't have
any unworldly view when they were born.

33:12.200 --> 33:13.760
Can't you talk politely?

33:15.480 --> 33:16.560
Madam Su,

33:16.640 --> 33:18.960
it's easy to verify their relationship.

33:19.040 --> 33:21.000
If you don't trust our artifact,

33:21.640 --> 33:23.880
use Mirage Palace's methods to test again.

33:24.840 --> 33:27.480
I know you don't want others
to know about your sister's story.

33:27.560 --> 33:29.800
That's why we are asking
about this in private.

33:31.320 --> 33:32.680
Don't you want to know

33:34.000 --> 33:35.720
if your sister has another daughter?

33:43.720 --> 33:46.400
Okay. Let me sleep on it.

33:47.160 --> 33:48.480
Do not reveal this

33:49.080 --> 33:50.720
to anyone else.

33:51.400 --> 33:52.400
Okay.

33:59.520 --> 34:02.880
Su Ningzhen did agree to a blood test.

34:03.720 --> 34:05.800
That means something strange

34:05.880 --> 34:08.440
did happen when Su Ningxi was in labor.

34:08.520 --> 34:10.120
That's why she's also suspicious.

34:11.159 --> 34:12.960
We will know tomorrow.

34:13.760 --> 34:14.960
Don't worry about it.

34:16.120 --> 34:17.159
Worry?

34:18.120 --> 34:19.719
I grew up with no parents by my side.

34:19.800 --> 34:21.120
I'm used to being alone.

34:21.199 --> 34:23.679
I've never thought of finding my family.

34:23.760 --> 34:25.840
It's just that having
a relationship with Gao Qiumin

34:25.920 --> 34:27.120
upsets me.

34:28.120 --> 34:30.840
The result better shows that
there's no connection between us.

34:30.920 --> 34:33.639
In that case, I won't need to hesitate

34:33.719 --> 34:35.480
when I kill Gao Qiumin.

34:36.480 --> 34:38.679
If you don't care about families
and have no expectations

34:39.600 --> 34:41.360
about your parents,

34:41.960 --> 34:43.679
why did you give up your task

34:43.760 --> 34:46.000
and come to Mirage Palace,
which is most hostile to the Spirit Clan?

34:48.679 --> 34:51.280
Because you will protect me.

34:52.760 --> 34:55.360
-How stubborn.
-What do you care?

35:04.240 --> 35:05.720
Related.

35:07.160 --> 35:09.400
How are they related?

35:10.080 --> 35:11.280
Why?

35:12.360 --> 35:13.200
Master.

35:13.840 --> 35:15.560
What are you looking for?

35:15.640 --> 35:16.800
Let me help you.

35:23.640 --> 35:26.040
DARK ABYSS

35:34.880 --> 35:36.520
Is it possible that she's…

35:43.240 --> 35:44.960
When we were in Snow City,

35:45.560 --> 35:46.400
Mu Xuanling mentioned

35:46.480 --> 35:48.560
that she was a spirit slave
in Moonlight Heights, right?

35:48.640 --> 35:50.760
She also mentioned that Gao Fengxu
tried to kill her before he died,

35:50.840 --> 35:51.800
right?

35:56.120 --> 35:57.600
People say
that she's a Spirit Clan member,

35:59.240 --> 36:00.600
yet no one has seen her original form.

36:01.960 --> 36:03.280
She said that
her spiritual apertures were damaged.

36:03.960 --> 36:06.480
She has no spiritual essence,
so she can't show her original form.

36:06.560 --> 36:08.440
So, how do you know for sure
that she's a Spirit Clan member?

36:09.320 --> 36:11.080
When she was young,
she had demon patterns on her face.

36:12.080 --> 36:13.760
Golden imprints,

36:13.840 --> 36:15.040
like runes.

36:15.120 --> 36:16.680
That cannot be seen on human faces.

36:16.760 --> 36:17.680
What kind of demon pattern?

36:17.760 --> 36:19.120
Draw it.

36:19.200 --> 36:20.200
Draw it and let me see.

36:50.240 --> 36:51.680
I see.

36:54.160 --> 36:55.360
This is

36:56.560 --> 36:57.680
the truth about the light.

37:06.160 --> 37:07.240
We were wrong.

37:07.920 --> 37:08.960
All of us were wrong.

37:13.120 --> 37:15.080
Master. What's going on with you?

37:15.760 --> 37:16.800
Master.

37:17.440 --> 37:18.480
Master.

37:29.320 --> 37:30.160
I'm in bed.

37:31.400 --> 37:32.880
I'm getting in after five seconds.

37:32.960 --> 37:34.840
I'm telling you that I'm in bed.

37:37.040 --> 37:38.080
Five.

37:39.400 --> 37:40.440
Four.

37:42.160 --> 37:43.360
Three.

37:44.360 --> 37:45.320
Two.

37:52.880 --> 37:55.240
-What is it?
-We are in Mirage Palace.

37:56.240 --> 37:57.280
I'm worried that you will stir things up.

38:01.880 --> 38:02.840
So?

38:02.920 --> 38:04.320
So, I'm going to keep you in check.

38:07.040 --> 38:09.720
WARBLE HALL

38:09.800 --> 38:11.080
Your mind is not clear right now.

38:12.160 --> 38:13.640
I think it's better for me to watch you.

38:14.680 --> 38:16.640
I was just staying in my room.

38:16.720 --> 38:18.360
You barged in in the middle of the night.

38:19.200 --> 38:20.160
Which one of us

38:21.600 --> 38:22.880
is confused right now?

38:22.960 --> 38:23.840
You, of course.

38:27.440 --> 38:28.600
Is that you being reasonable?

38:30.800 --> 38:32.320
I've tried to be reasonable.

38:33.240 --> 38:35.120
-Did that work?
-Of course!

38:36.440 --> 38:38.160
When you reasoned with me,

38:38.240 --> 38:39.680
I felt like my mind was cleansed,

38:39.760 --> 38:42.480
and I wanted to be
a good person deep down.

38:45.000 --> 38:46.560
What's the most important thing
about being a good person?

38:48.440 --> 38:49.800
Do not lie.

38:53.960 --> 38:55.040
Fine.

38:55.800 --> 38:58.200
Maybe I'm not that eager

38:58.280 --> 38:59.680
to be a good person.

39:00.280 --> 39:01.720
How about you?

39:01.800 --> 39:03.320
You insisted

39:03.400 --> 39:04.600
on hanging out in my room
at such a late hour.

39:04.680 --> 39:07.080
That's not up to a gentleman's code.

39:08.000 --> 39:09.840
I am no gentleman.

39:10.600 --> 39:12.160
I can be ruthless.

39:13.400 --> 39:15.160
If you don't want me to knock you out,

39:16.040 --> 39:17.000
stay put.

39:21.680 --> 39:23.040
Xie Xuechen.

39:24.040 --> 39:26.120
You know that I'm not a good person.

39:26.720 --> 39:28.920
Why do you have to fancy me?

39:37.320 --> 39:38.720
I don't want to tell you right now.

39:40.760 --> 39:42.160
If you want to know,

39:43.080 --> 39:44.200
stay by my side.

39:45.160 --> 39:46.120
Don't leave.

39:51.960 --> 39:53.240
What if

39:54.040 --> 39:56.040
I do a horrible thing one day?

39:57.600 --> 39:59.080
Will you still fancy me?

40:00.000 --> 40:00.840
Yes.

40:04.160 --> 40:05.360
But I will be watching you,

40:06.600 --> 40:08.360
so that you won't have
a chance to do that.

40:16.600 --> 40:18.600
This man lives like a monk,

40:19.240 --> 40:21.760
but his sweet words are so determined.

40:22.400 --> 40:23.600
How strange!

40:26.040 --> 40:29.320
We will know a few facts tomorrow.

40:29.400 --> 40:31.440
About the Chaos Pearl, Su Ningxi,

40:31.520 --> 40:32.920
and your identity.

40:33.920 --> 40:35.000
Tonight,

40:36.240 --> 40:37.280
stay and behave.

40:52.120 --> 40:59.040
REJUVENATION PAVILION

41:24.440 --> 41:28.000
What did Master mean today?

41:29.120 --> 41:30.800
I was supposed to investigate
the Chaos Pearl.

41:31.760 --> 41:33.520
How come I just keep
getting more mysteries?

41:35.280 --> 41:37.080
I wonder if it's a good thing

41:37.600 --> 41:39.440
if the whole truth comes out.

41:46.120 --> 41:46.960
Miss Gao.

41:50.720 --> 41:51.800
What brought you here?

41:54.120 --> 41:56.240
I thought you were going
to wait outside the palace.

41:56.320 --> 41:57.680
Are you here to make fun of me?

41:58.280 --> 41:59.400
No, of course.

42:01.680 --> 42:03.000
I got you some snacks.

42:07.680 --> 42:08.800
I don't want you

42:10.000 --> 42:11.880
to feel sad over what happened lately.

42:19.640 --> 42:22.800
Even if I want to feel sad,
I don't even know where to get started.

42:27.320 --> 42:28.880
There are so many things

42:30.480 --> 42:33.120
that I want to know about my mother.

42:34.320 --> 42:35.680
Did she love Sang Qi?

42:36.680 --> 42:38.200
Or did she love my father?

42:39.840 --> 42:41.960
If she gave up love

42:42.800 --> 42:44.320
and married into Moonlight Heights,

42:47.200 --> 42:49.120
has she ever been happy?

42:52.680 --> 42:54.640
Did she look forward to my birth?

42:58.440 --> 43:00.000
My father used to tell me

43:00.080 --> 43:02.560
that he loved my mother deeply.

43:04.000 --> 43:06.920
It's just that my mother
was taken away too soon

43:08.280 --> 43:09.680
when giving birth to me.

43:14.920 --> 43:16.320
Judging from what we know,

43:21.040 --> 43:23.200
that might be nothing but a lie.
